These work because every choice belongs to the brand's world and repeats with discipline.

Answer as one JSON object matching the schema: `directions`, a list where each entry has `scene`, `colours` (three objects with `role` as ground, light or signal, `name` and `hex`), `display`, `body`, `rationale`, `hero` and `css`. Do not include contrast ratios or oklch values in the JSON; the library computes them.
